@baseUrl = https://localhost:7201
@token = paste-access-token-here
@patientId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Register a patient (Admin or Receptionist). Repeat to verify 409.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Sara",
  "lastName": "Ahmadi",
  "nationalCode": "1234567890",
  "birthDate": "1995-05-12",
  "gender": 2
}

### Set patientId to the ID returned by registration.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid registration: expect 400.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "Ahmadi",
  "nationalCode": "",
  "birthDate": "2999-01-01",
  "gender": 99
}
